.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH QUIPU-GIT-MERGE-RESOLVE 1 "" quipu "Quipu Manual"
.SH NAME
quipu\-git\-merge\-resolve \- Record one choice in the Git merge in progress and rewrite the qpack
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBquipu git\-merge resolve\fR [\fB\-\-db\fR] [\fB\-\-choose\fR] [\fB\-\-by\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIqpack\-dir\fR> <\fIkey\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Record one choice in the Git merge in progress and rewrite the qpack
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-db\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Store file (default: .bobbin/quipu/quipu.db; configuration may override it)
.TP
\fB\-\-choose\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
Conflict side to choose
.TP
\fB\-\-by\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
Identity recording a resolution
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIqpack\-dir\fR>

.TP
<\fIkey\fR>

